      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0008",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "When stopped with this method, [`runModal(for:)`](nsapplication/runmodal(for:).md) and [`runModalSession(_:)`](nsapplication/runmodalsession(_:).md) return `NSModalResponseAbort`.",
      "normalizedSource": "When stopped with this method, [`runModal(for:)`](nsapplication/runmodal(for:).md) and [`runModalSession(_:)`](nsapplication/runmodalsession(_:).md) return `NSModalResponseAbort`.",
      "sourceHash": "1eae9b3596898da70d7635b0daba12f37a5dc7abaa756ad078deca1eb995c29c",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Discussion",
      "contextAfter": "[`abortModal()`](nsapplication/abortmodal().md) must be used instead of [`stopModal()`](nsapplication/stopmodal().md) or [`stopModal(withCode:)`](nsapplication/stopmodal(withcode:).md) when you need to stop a modal event loop from anywhere other than a callout from that event loop.",
